Scenario: View Success Message Text
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Blogs|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Add Entry
	And BlogsEntry add Entry Content
		|entryContent|Blogs Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Title|
	Then Alert view Success Message Text
		|sucessMessage|Your request completed successfully.|